## 1. Implementation steps (with target paths)

The "implementation" is the review-agent procedure that produces one Markdown artifact. Steps execute in this exact order to honor the AC ordering constraints.

| # | Step | Target / command |
|---|---|---|
| S1 | **Resolve git root** — walk ancestors for `.git/`. If none, apply fallback root = `PROJECT_ROOT` and record the deviation (see Risk R1). | cwd → `/home/bradleyjerome/projects/ai/epam-test-apps/hello-world` |
| S2 | **Create `review/` unconditionally** (idempotent), then **check for pre-existing report** `review/HW-003-review.md`. If present → Blocker, FAIL, exit ≠0, do not write. | `<root>/review/HW-003-review.md` |
| S3 | **Load HW-001 ACs verbatim** from the orchestration payload (AC-1…AC-15) — copy, never paraphrase. | from invocation payload |
| S4 | **Pre-flight gates:** if `greet.ts`/`greet.test.ts` missing → Blocker(s), exact body `Test suite not executed (missing source files)`, FAIL, exit≠0, skip tests. If vitest binary unresolvable → Blocker, exact body `Test suite not executed (vitest binary not found)`, FAIL, exit≠0. | `<root>/greet.ts`, `greet.test.ts`, `node_modules/.bin/vitest` |
| S5 | **Run tests with 60 s wall-clock timeout**; capture combined stdout+stderr + numeric exit code (or `timeout` after SIGTERM). Resolve the node binary via PATH, not the dead hardcoded path (Risk R2). | `node ./node_modules/.bin/vitest run` |
| S6 | **Evaluate each HW-001 AC** → per-criterion PASS/FAIL against current `greet.ts`. | analysis of `greet.ts` |
| S7 | **Compute verdict** — PASS iff (all HW-001 ACs PASS) ∧ (exit 0) ∧ (zero Blockers); else FAIL. | logic |
| S8 | **Render report** (templated, format-exact): `## Summary` (one word) → `## Criteria Checklist` (AC-1…AC-N verbatim + PASS/FAIL) → `## Findings` (severity-sorted, 4 fields, or `No findings`) → `## Test Output` (fenced block + `Exit code: <int>`). | write `<root>/review/HW-003-review.md` |
| S9 | **Immutability check** — confirm `greet.ts`, `greet.test.ts`, `package.json` unmodified. `git diff` if git root real; else checksum/mtime comparison fallback (Risk R1). | git diff / hash compare |
| S10 | **Exit** with OS status 0 (PASS) or ≥1 (FAIL). | process exit |

**Protected-path compliance:** only `review/HW-003-review.md` is written. `greet.ts`, `greet.test.ts`, `package.json`, `tsconfig.json`, `main.ts`, `.epam/`, `orchestrations/` are never touched.

